(footprint "Relay_Panasonic_ADW1_1coil" (version 20221018) (generator hwflow_projlib)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Panasonic ADW1 (DW) 1 Form A latching 1-coil, low profile HL, body 24 x 10 x 15.8 mm. Source: Panasonic DW relays catalog ASCTB8E 202403 (mm.digikey.com/Volume0/opasdata/d220001/medias/docus/8811/mech_eng_dw.pdf) p.7 'Inrush type (low profile)': recommended PC board pattern (bottom view) 4-1.2 dia holes, 17.5 + 3.5 mm along, 7.5 mm across, tol +-0.1; external dimensions 24 x 10 x 15.8 mm, pin 1 1.5 mm from the body end, tol +-0.3. Pin map: pad 13 = pin 3, pad 14 = pin 5 (Form A contacts), pad A1 = pin 1 (coil -, reset), pad A2 = pin 6 (coil +, reset). Top view = mirror of the bottom-view pattern. Pad d 2.5 (contacts) / 2.0 (coil) chosen")
  (tags "relay panasonic ADW1 DW latching")
